   1 strop <version> · help · / search · q close                                                                                              ▮
   2                                                                                                                                       ▮
   3 ─ Moving ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────▮
   4    h j k l                       move (never off the line)                                                                            ▮
   5    w b e W B E                   word / WORD motions                                                                                  ▮
   6    zz zt zb                      center/top/bottom the cursor line                                                                     
   7    H M L                         top/middle/bottom visible line                                                                        
   8    g;                            older change (changelist)                                                                             
   9    g,                            newer change (changelist)                                                                             
  10    ge gE { }                     word-end back / paragraph motions                                                                     
  11    0 $ G %                       line/file/pair jumps                                                                                  
  12    g<space>                      collection: open full source at caret                                                                 
  13    gg                            top of file                                                                                           
  14    enter                         line down, first non-blank (blame gutter: dive)                                                       
  15    tab                           jump list forward (ctrl-i)                                                                            
  16    ctrl-d ctrl-u ctrl-f ctrl-b   half/full page scroll (count = lines)                                                                 
  17    ctrl-^                        alternate buffer                                                                                      
  18    grr                           references (LSP)                                                                                      
  19    grn                           rename the symbol under the cursor (prompts with its name)                                            
  20    gI                            implementation (LSP)                                                                                  
  21    gy                            type definition (LSP)                                                                                 
  22    gD                            declaration (LSP)                                                                                     
  23    ]d                            next diagnostic                                                                                       
  24    [d                            previous diagnostic                                                                                   
  25    gd                            goto definition (LSP)                                                                                 
  26    gs                            switch source/header (clangd)                                                                         
  27    f<c> F<c> t<c> T<c>           find/till char (candidates light up)                                                                  
  28    ]q                            next quickfix hit                                                                                     
  29    [q                            previous quickfix hit                                                                                 
  30    ]f                            next file card (collections)                                                                          
  31    [f                            previous file card (collections)                                                                      
  32    ]e                            next excerpt (collections; +/- context)                                                               
  33    [e                            previous excerpt (collections; +/- context)                                                           
  34    ]c                            next git hunk                                                                                         
  35    [c                            previous git hunk                                                                                     
  36    m<a>                          set mark at cursor                                                                                    
  37    '<a> `<a>                     jump to mark                                                                                          
  38    ; ,                           repeat find, same / reversed                                                                          
  39    |                             column motion (vim); pipe moved to space |                                                            
